    {
      "fragment_id": "0068_Txl1nmb84VA_Paul_Ash_-_AI4IA_2025_0006",
      "source_video": "0068_Txl1nmb84VA_Paul_Ash_-_AI4IA_2025",
      "video_id": "Txl1nmb84VA",
      "fragment_index": 6,
      "start": 297.56,
      "end": 352.42,
      "duration": 54.86,
      "text": "For championing transparency, ethical governance and global collaboration, we can ensure AI becomes a force for good and not a vector for harm. The Christchurch call community is deeply invested in this mission. Together, governments, platforms, civil society and researchers, we work to uphold the values of safety, dignity and respect online. We invite all stakeholders to join us in advancing responsible AI practices that protect communities, preserve democratic integrity and foster a safer digital future for all, with a clear focus on managing the risks and eliminating terrorist and violent extremist content online. Thank you for your time today. I hope that's been a helpful outline of the intersection between AI governance work and our mission, and I wish you all the very best for your deliberations today. Thank you very much.",
